<title>SINGAPORE: MCL Land wins sites at government tender.</title>
<headline>MCL Land wins sites at government tender.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Urban Redevelopment Authority said on Thursday it awarded two residential sites in northern part of Singapore for a total of Singapore $102.09 million to MCL Land Ltd.</p>
<p>A third site, also for residential development, has been awarded to Lim Kah Ngam for S$44.72 million.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
